 false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 31, "count": 3}]}, {"recommendationid": "214034806", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993946747", "personaname": "Wildman1955", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993946747/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 21871, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 978, "playtime_at_review": 2423, "last_played": 1791158667, "avatar": "c1137c32a35f8db2bed7081c1581fb2792c338f5"}, "language": "english", "review": "same as sniper elite 5", "timestamp_created": 1766526830, "timestamp_updated": 1766526830, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214025248", "author": {"steamid": "76561198783000685", "personaname": "emielsteen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198783000685/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 13659, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1151, "playtime_at_review": 308, "last_played": 1791487097, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game.", "timestamp_created": 1766518429, "timestamp_updated": 1766518429, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213995404", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086546191", "personaname": "tox.cda", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198086546191/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 4357, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1716, "last_played": 1769227106, "avatar": "eef75511ba1f16b66e9ac45346e7c0f790a6551a"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's basically a DLC for SE5, but the maps are smaller, more compact. Most of the maps I enjoyed a lot, you could see the effort and detail that went into those, but 2 maps felt very neglected.\n\nWhat was a big difference compared to SE5 is that in Resistance I'm using the sniper rifle more often, there was a lot more verticality in the level design, more advantage in longshots compared to melee takedowns. \nHaven't done infiltration playthrough yet, I felt trigger happy and just had to let it out of my system xD\n\nOh, and the real game-changer for me.. the new character you play as is very annoying, but if you change the loadout to the female french resistance fighter she barely said 3 words the whole campaign. So if the new guy's voice lines get to you, just make the switch and enjoy the silence ^^  \n\n", "timestamp_created": 1766493560, "timestamp_updated": 1766651033, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "65366", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600KF", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060", "vram_size": 12115}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213990317", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015850074", "personaname": "Ca55", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198015850074/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 6322, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5248, "last_played": 1783630467, "avatar": "d4fbe6b8c96fd091c5ffb154486e68517bdfa0a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decided to change my previous negative review. \nAfter finishing the game and playing through all of the Survival levels and Propaganda missions, I actually do recommend this now. While I wish there were more new Survival maps, for the price, I think there's enough content here to justify your money.", "timestamp_created": 1766488192, "timestamp_updated": 1778052250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213967441", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162323556", "personaname": "Kage446", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198162323556/", "num_games_owned": 69, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1790, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1284, "last_played": 1768100380, "avatar": "4e81aded4c600894641070a55283e1e5d6b7d315"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game and love the missions", "timestamp_created": 1766458492, "timestamp_updated": 1766458492, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213967156", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030604344", "personaname": "Tyrannosaurus Tux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tyrannosaurus_Tux/", "num_games_owned": 410, "num_reviews": 90, "playtime_forever": 705, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 526, "last_played": 1766637529, "avatar": "bfff47cea9f60f44cfee2b740834d1b952bb248d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rebellion, please... you'd be so much bigger as a company if you didn't greedmaxx. Your games are good. Your business practices aren't. These EA practices... have diminishing returns.", "timestamp_created": 1766458119, "timestamp_updated": 1766458268, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213937986", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081237036", "personaname": "Gaius Cellius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MOUSETASTIC/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 295, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 263, "last_played": 1768835238, "avatar": "688bb48c7a3f26f0b12285535644a97a58bb6a3e"}, "language": "english", "review": "lot of things are better with resistance - like climbing but the athmosphere is kinda lacking it feels bland. The map looks kinda big but it really isnt, compared with SE 5.  This game should have been a bigger then usual dlc.\r\n\r\nBig con: putting a paywall on the K98 thats petty.\r\n\r\nReally wish Steam would allow us an recommendation between yes/no.\r\n\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1766430610, "timestamp_updated": 1766430610, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213936325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044460143", "personaname": "Soul", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IX-CyberShot/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 1, "playt